  step,dige:83d178fe182f5ae4
  step=2,dige:dec91a81098c575d
  step=3,dige:e7a8d1a20a9fb2fc
    Assertion:a-borrowed-grant-never,sentence:a borrowed grant never changes who won it — the loan always names the original bearer as winner and never the Cave presenting it
    Assertion:only-the-grant-s,sentence:only the grant's own bearer may lend it — a body that does not hold the grant cannot mint a loan off it
    Assertion:a-forged-loan-around,sentence:a forged loan around a real grant is refused — the outer signature must be the grant's own bearer and never a borrower or a stranger
    Assertion:a-borrowed-grant-expires,sentence:a borrowed grant expires on its own — checked past its TTL the loan is refused with no revocation needed
  step=4,dige:e34605ec0e2c9efd
    Assertion:a-friendship-seats-its,sentence:a friendship seats its Captain and one Cave at once — lending to a Cave never logs the Captain out
    Assertion:a-newer-presentation-takes,sentence:a newer presentation takes the seat — the previous borrower is logged out and only the borrower itself can present its loan
    Assertion:a-lapsed-loan-frees,sentence:a lapsed loan frees the Cave seat with nothing sent — and lending to itself ends a loan early
    Assertion:a-friend-only-honours,sentence:a friend only honours a loan of a grant it issued itself — a loan of anyone else is refused
  step=5,dige:646c87c699c09220
    Assertion:the-captain-is-never,sentence:the Captain is never logged out by its Cave — switching to that friend itself takes nothing back and both stay seated
    Assertion:while-the-captain-is,sentence:while the Captain is online every online Cave holds its own loan per friend — renewed before it lapses and not re-sent while fresh
    Assertion:a-cave-lists-its,sentence:a Cave lists its Captain's friends — live while its loan stands and needing the Captain once it lapses
    Assertion:switching-to-a-friend,sentence:switching to a friend presents the Cave's own loan and the friend seats it — a lapsed loan sends nothing and says the Captain must come online
